# Boarding pass template of an airline: the document documents/examples/boarding-pass with Slots for each booking.
# The layout of Northwind Air (the card over the grey sheet, the band with its mark, the labels of the details, the
# stub and the notches) is part of the template; the travellers and the trip in the title, the booking and its
# flights, and the passes, one per page, come in the data. A pass has its id, the passenger, the flight, the date,
# the two airports with their cities and times, the duration, the boarding time, the gate, the seat, the zone, the
# data of the PDF417 barcode (the IATA boarding pass), the note beside it and the code of the Code 128 barcode of the
# stub. The note is Markdown. boarding-pass.json has the sample data.
#
# Each pass is a card with rounded corners over a grey sheet, on a custom page size of 210 × 99 mm (Width and Height
# in Page): a Grid of two columns, the pass and the stub, split by a dashed line (Border style: dashed) with two
# notches cut at its ends (Page overlay circles of the colour of the sheet). The airports and the flight time share a
# baseline (Vertical: baseline in a Stack) although their sizes differ, the details go in a Grid of labels and values,
# the pass carries the PDF417 barcode that gate readers scan (Barcode format: pdf417) and the stub, a Code 128 of the
# booking reference with its readable text. The airline mark is a small SVG.
Document (dev.stxt.pdf):
	Page:
		Width: 210mm
		Height: 99mm
		Margin: 6mm
	Title: Boarding passes · ${travellers} · ${trip}
	Subject: Boarding passes of booking ${booking}, flights ${flights}
	Author: Northwind Air
	Language: en
	Page overlay:
		Id: sheet
		Offset: -6mm
		Layer: -2
		Box:
			Background: #DCE4E8
	Page overlay:
		Id: notch-top
		Offset: -3mm auto auto 135mm
		Block:
			Style: notch
	Page overlay:
		Id: notch-bottom
		Offset: auto auto -3mm 135mm
		Block:
			Style: notch
	Section: [passes]
		Id: <id>
		Grid:
			Id: pass-${id}
			Style: pass
			Area:
				Block:
					Style: main
					Stack:
						Style: band
						Item:
							Image: documents/boarding-pass/northwind.svg
								Style: logo
						Item:
							Grow: 1
							Text: Northwind Air
								Style: airline
						Item:
							Text: Boarding pass
								Style: band-label
					Block:
						Style: main-body
						Stack:
							Style: route
							Item:
								Block:
									Text: <from>
										Style: airport
									Text: ${from_city} · ${departure}
										Style: city
							Item:
								Text: →
									Style: arrow
							Item:
								Block:
									Text: <to>
										Style: airport
									Text: ${to_city} · ${arrival}
										Style: city
							Item:
								Grow: 1
								Text: <duration>
									Style: duration
						Grid:
							Style: fields
							Area: 1 1 1 2
								Block:
									Text: Passenger
										Style: label
									Text: <passenger>
										Style: value
							Area:
								Block:
									Text: Flight
										Style: label
									Text: <flight>
										Style: value
							Area:
								Block:
									Text: Date
										Style: label
									Text: <date>
										Style: value
							Area:
								Block:
									Text: Boarding
										Style: label
									Text: <boarding>
										Style: value accent
							Area:
								Block:
									Text: Gate
										Style: label
									Text: <gate>
										Style: value accent
							Area:
								Block:
									Text: Seat
										Style: label
									Text: <seat>
										Style: value accent
							Area:
								Block:
									Text: Zone
										Style: label
									Text: <zone>
										Style: value
						Stack:
							Style: scan
							Item:
								Barcode: <barcode>
									Id: bcbp-${id}
									Barcode format: pdf417
									Alt: PDF417 boarding pass barcode for flight ${flight}, seat ${seat}
									Style: pdf417
							Item:
								Grow: 1
								Paragraph: <note>
									Style: note
			Area:
				Block:
					Style: stub
					Text: Northwind Air
						Style: stub-airline
					Grid:
						Style: stub-fields
						Area: 1 1 1 2
							Block:
								Text: Passenger
									Style: label
								Text: <passenger>
									Style: value small
						Area:
							Block:
								Text: Flight
									Style: label
								Text: <flight>
									Style: value small
						Area:
							Block:
								Text: Route
									Style: label
								Text: ${from} → ${to}
									Style: value small
						Area:
							Block:
								Text: Seat
									Style: label
								Text: <seat>
									Style: value small accent
						Area:
							Block:
								Text: Gate
									Style: label
								Text: <gate>
									Style: value small accent
					Barcode: <stub_barcode>
						Id: stub-${id}
						Barcode format: code-128
						Readable text: true
						Alt: Code 128 barcode of booking ${booking} on flight ${flight}
						Style: code128
